### 2. Key Technical Clues
*   **"C++26 will likely have stackful coroutines..."**: As of late 2023, C++26 was still in the proposal stage. The mention of "stackful coroutines" as a *future* feature for C++26 aligns with the timeline before C++26 was finalized (which is expected around 2026).
