*   **"I’ve been responsible for some CVEs (including font parsing code in Android)"**: Raph Levien has publicly acknowledged past security issues in his code. This self-reflection is consistent with his public statements in 2023.
*   **"Linebender projects... most likely it will be CMake"**: The Linebender ecosystem (Vello, Xilem) was actively exploring C++ interop and potential rewrites in late 2023. The decision to move away from Rust was a major topic in the graphics programming community during this period.

